webm?t=1764704840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/689db91653712ddc71b47d53fd81cde7.mp4?t=1764704840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Evolving Mechanics</u></strong> <br>From platform puzzles to <strong>rail grinding</strong> and <strong>FPS balloon-shooting sections</strong>, expect your skills and teamwork to be tested in unexpected ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/d866e0612469bfa9ded152e784503318.poster.avif?t=1764704840\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/d866e0612469bfa9ded152e784503318.webm?t=1764704840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/d866e0612469bfa9ded152e784503318.mp4?t=1764704840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Challenging Platforms, Epic Climb</u></strong><br>Jump, climb, balance, and move in harmony. Only the most coordinated pairs will reach the summit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/66fa72b5d9343ca94be4bea0bb9f2eda.poster.avif?t=1764704840\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/66fa72b5d9343ca94be4bea0bb9f2eda.webm?t=1764704840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extra