/3722820/c61b1badd9f74639b4decddcea81db30b3d71cf8/ss_c61b1badd9f74639b4decddcea81db30b3d71cf8.600x338.jpg?t=1764704840"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/4d89f868518863a28adb48a38735377290169834/ss_4d89f868518863a28adb48a38735377290169834.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764704840","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/4d89f868518863a28adb48a38735377290169834/ss_4d89f868518863a28adb48a38735377290169834.600x338.jpg?t=1764704840"}],"short_description":"A lightning strike, a torch in your hands, and a voice echoes: \u201cYour fates are now bound.\u201d Tied together by a fragile rope \u2014 if it snaps, the fall is inevitable. Jump, climb, solve, slide\u2026 but never lose your rhythm. Only the patient will glimpse the summit.","steam_appid":3722820,"support_info":{"email":"onlympicup@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Greek, Czech, Swedish","type":"game","website":null}